OL,3,GNEWSAYoung kayaker rescued among seven
OL,4,ARNLI call-outs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young person in an inflatable kayak
OL,7,Fwas rescued from the sea after being
OL,8,Fblown half a mile off the coast at
OL,9,FFleetwood.
OL,11,FIt happened on Wednesday at about 19:30
OL,12,FBST while the Royal National Lifeboat
OL,13,FInstitution (RNLI) were on a training
OL,14,Fexercise.
OL,16,FThe RNLI said it was one of seven
OL,17,Fcall-outs it had received in the last
OL,18,Fthree days.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
