OL,3,GNEWSAYoung kayaker rescued among seven
OL,4,ARNLI call-outs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther calls included rescuing two
OL,7,Fpeople cut off by the incoming tide on
OL,8,Fa sandbank at Cleveleys, welfare
OL,9,Fconcerns at all three piers in
OL,10,FBlackpool and a person found in
OL,11,Fdistress in the sea off Gynn Square in
OL,12,FBlackpool.
